2. Brightcove Live
Brightcove Live is our live streaming solution, which enables non-technical users to set up live events without the need for hardware encoders or
development work. Brightcove Live leverages our globally distributed architecture, and delivers high quality viewer experience across multiple
platforms and devices. It includes features such as live clipping, which allows customers to create and publish clips of a live stream to social channels;
security through DRM encryption; the ability to create video-on-demand assets from a live stream; and the ability to allow viewers to pause, play and
rewind a live stream.
